# 41. Role Dashboards: Nursing

Roles: `nurse`, `ward_nurse`, `icu_nurse`, `ot_nurse`, `nursing_supervisor` (`matron`), `infection_control_nurse`, `home_nursing_admin`.
**Family rule:** task-first, scan-to-verify (wristband + drug), offline-first, shift-bound access, large touch targets, no decorative motion. Note: `nursing_supervisor`, `matron`, `ward_nurse` abhi `nurse` spec par alias hain: alag spec chahiye; `ot_nurse` ka koi spec nahi.

### Nurse (ward / general) (`nurse`)
- **Purpose:** Bedside task-first view: due meds, vitals, orders, handover, alerts.
- **Current status:** spec `hmsDashboardSpec` · route `/dashboards/nurse` · current depth: 4 KPIs / 3 tasks / 2 alerts / 4 queues / 4 actions / 2 modules
- **KPI cards (target):** Patients assigned; Meds due now (next 2h) / overdue; Vitals due / overdue; Orders to acknowledge; NEWS2 ≥5 patients; Handover items
- **Worklists / queues:** "Due now" list grouped by time (MAR); Vitals due; Orders to ack; Assigned patients with flags (fall/pressure/isolation/allergy); Intake-output balance; Pending admissions/discharges
- **Alerts:** Missed dose; NEWS2 high; Critical result; Fall-risk bed alarm; Restraint review due
- **Quick actions:** Record vitals, Give med (scan), Nursing note, Request doctor review, SBAR handover
- **Sections / tabs:** My patients · MAR · Vitals · Orders · Handover · Care plans
- **Features:** Barcode wristband + drug scan (5 rights) with hard-stop on mismatch; MAR with missed-dose alerts; Fall (Morse)/pressure (Braden)/pain scores; I/O auto balance, wound care, lines & catheters (days in situ); Offline-first PWA with encrypted store + sync bar; Shift handover (SBAR); Care plan
- **Data / APIs:** `/nursing/*`, `/ipd/{vitals,mar,io,nursing-notes,wound-care}`, `/scan/verify`, `/forms/*`
- **Permissions & privacy:** Assigned patients; shift-bound login; PHI watermark on screen.
- **Mobile:** Primary device: phone/tablet; swipe-to-give-med with confirm; haptics for critical.

### Ward Nurse (in-charge of ward) (`ward_nurse`)
- **Purpose:** Ward-level view (currently aliased to `nurse`).
- **Current status:** **koi dedicated dashboard spec nahi** (shell/spec banana hoga)
- **KPI cards (target):** Ward occupancy; Staff on shift vs required; Pending admissions/discharges; Incidents today; Bed cleaning pending
- **Worklists / queues:** Ward bed board; Task allocation per nurse; Isolation list; Supplies low (ward store)
- **Alerts:** Understaffed shift; Isolation breach; Indent pending
- **Quick actions:** Allocate nurse, Request supplies, Raise incident
- **Sections / tabs:** Ward board · Assignments · Indents · Incidents
- **Features:** Nurse–patient assignment board; Ward indent to store; Infection precautions list
- **Data / APIs:** `/nursing/*`, `/stores/indents`, `/work-tasks`
- **Permissions & privacy:** Ward scope.

### ICU Nurse (`icu_nurse`)
- **Purpose:** Hourly flowsheet, ventilator care, infusion & alarms.
- **Current status:** spec `hmsDashboardSpec` · route `/dashboards/icu_nurse` · current depth: 4 KPIs / 3 tasks / 1 alerts / 4 queues / 4 actions / 1 modules
- **KPI cards (target):** ICU patients assigned; Hourly obs due; Infusions running (rate checks); Ventilator bundles done; Alarms active
- **Worklists / queues:** Hourly flowsheet queue; Infusion/pump checks; Line/catheter care; Turning schedule (pressure care)
- **Alerts:** Obs overdue; Infusion nearing end; Alarm unacked
- **Quick actions:** Chart hourly obs, Check infusion, Log turning
- **Sections / tabs:** Flowsheet · Devices · Bundles · I/O
- **Features:** Device-integration vitals feed (HL7/MQTT); Bundle checklists (VAP/CLABSI); GCS/sedation scores; I/O hourly
- **Data / APIs:** `/icu/*`, `/hub/*`
- **Permissions & privacy:** ICU scope.
- **Mobile:** Bedside tablet.

