### Nursing Supervisor / Matron (`nursing_supervisor`)
- **Purpose:** Staffing, ratios, quality, incident review (currently aliased to `nurse`: needs own spec).
- **Current status:** **koi dedicated dashboard spec nahi** (shell/spec banana hoga)
- **KPI cards (target):** Nurse:patient ratio by ward; Staff on duty vs roster; Overtime hours; Incidents (falls, med errors); Documentation compliance %; Leave requests
- **Worklists / queues:** Roster with gaps; Swap/leave approvals; Incident review queue; Audit checklists (hand hygiene); Training/credential due
- **Alerts:** Ratio breach; Roster gap next shift; Credential expiry; Falls trend
- **Quick actions:** Approve swap, Reassign nurse, Start audit, Open roster
- **Sections / tabs:** Staffing · Roster · Incidents · Audits · Competency
- **Features:** Acuity-based staffing suggestions; Shift handover quality audit; Ward-wise KPI board; Competency tracker
- **Data / APIs:** `/roster/*`, `/safety/incidents`, `/credentials`
- **Permissions & privacy:** Nursing scope; PHI minimal.

### Infection Control Nurse (`infection_control_nurse`)
- **Purpose:** HAI surveillance, isolation, hand hygiene, stewardship.
- **Current status:** spec `hmsDashboardSpec` · route `/dashboards/infection_control_nurse` · current depth: 4 KPIs / 3 tasks / 1 alerts / 4 queues / 4 actions / 1 modules
- **KPI cards (target):** HAI rates (CAUTI/CLABSI/VAP/SSI); Isolation patients; Hand-hygiene compliance; Needle-stick injuries; Antibiotic restricted approvals
- **Worklists / queues:** Surveillance worklist (device days, cultures); Isolation bed list; Outbreak watch; PEP follow-ups; Audit checklists
- **Alerts:** Cluster ≥2 same ward/7d; MDR organism; Needle-stick without PEP
- **Quick actions:** Open surveillance case, Flag isolation, Start hygiene audit, Approve antibiotic
- **Sections / tabs:** Surveillance · Isolation · Hygiene · Stewardship · Needle-stick
- **Features:** HAI case definitions & rates; Isolation sync with bed board; Antibiogram from microbiology; Stewardship approvals; Needle-stick + PEP tracker
- **Data / APIs:** `/infection-control/*`, lab micro results, bed board
- **Permissions & privacy:** Case-level identifiable data with purpose log.

